n lineage, against current C2 evidence.\n\n**Status:** all seven obligations remain open. No application success is established yet.","contributions":[{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5","contribution":"Re-measure the corrected current subject (generated/hello-world.mjs, sha256:fe8f4080…) with the same fixed prospective commands:\n- command 0: `node generated/hello-world.mjs`\n- command 1: `node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs`\n\nRun both against the actual current files. Record the real command, args, env, cwd, exit status, stdout/stderr and test pass/fail counts, including any nonzero exit.\n\nLink this measurement to Construction result 1f11… as its subject lineage. Keep baseline result 7d8d… as separate historical evidence about the earlier bytes; do not overwrite or retarget it.","reason":"The behavior obligation needs admitted verifier execution on the corrected bytes: CLI stdout exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\", exit 0, at least 2 real passing tests and 0 failures. The revision obligation needs the post-correction verifier execution in the same lineage, next to the preserved baseline failure.\n\nConstruction is complete, so it is cited as evidence, not as a dependency. Its self-run checks are the author's report, not admitted evidence. The command plan is fixed and needs no author.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","result://abiogenesis/1f11cf4c619b59bf0b318df4eb5484ed751e9fae66e612c16ce8f9c2b252ec83","result://abiogenesis/7d8d7f5fb42032f75ae9dc9e25aa3ca1583a3d2977bb54dece7f63130970ab02","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/9d4e7f30ffd1db725858c76dbdb4626145991367cb705f606b2b79e6a4ee049a"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5","contribution":"Write specification/project-conformance.md. It must declare the minimal CLI Hello World software-build traversal and include:\n- Intent\n- Product boundary\n- source-grounded requirements\n- generated/hello-world.mjs as the source surface\n- completion criteria, including an execution proof that runs the CLI and observes stdout exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\" with exit 0\n\nDo not write source, tests, package files or execution plans.","reason":"The conformance asset is still absent and must be produced by fresh native work. Under the original conformance_project stage, it is the authority for implementation design. It does not depend on the completed CLI correction. Its meaning is unchanged from the prior mapping.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/9d4e7f30ffd1db725858c76dbdb4626145991367cb705f606b2b79e6a4ee049a","result://abiogenesis/6a98a4611cf09371812efe97e2bb02c52047573450945ccbe2a072f36b80e33e"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/design@5","contribution":"Write three assets:\n- **design/implementation-design.md**: a minimal Node CLI at generated/hello-world.mjs that prints exactly \"Hello, world!\" plus one newline. It takes the conformance asset as authority and names the component and UAT test surfaces.\n- **design/test-design.md**: component and UAT validation. Both spawn node generated/hello-world.mjs and assert status 0 and stdout exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\", matching the actual supplied tests.\n- **test-execution-plan.json**:\n  - command: node\n  - args: [\"--test\",\"test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs\",\"test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs\"]\n  - expectedTestPassCount: at least 2\n  - expectedStdoutMatch: stable zero-failure evidence such as fail 0\n  - assertedReturnValue: \"Hello, world!\"\n\nThe plan must agree with the fixed commands but does not control execution.","reason":"All three assets are still absent and must be freshly written. The original implementation_design stage takes the prior conformance artifact as authority. The test design must match the real test surfaces. The baseline shows those surfaces execute the CLI and assert its exact output. The meaning of this row is unchanged from the prior mapping.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/9d4e7f30ffd1db725858c76dbdb4626145991367cb705f606b2b79e6a4ee049a","result://abiogenesis/7d8d7f5fb42032f75ae9dc9e25aa3ca1583a3d2977bb54dece7f63130970ab02","result://abiogenesis/1f11cf4c619b59bf0b318df4eb5484ed751e9fae66e612c16ce8f9c2b252ec83"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5"]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","contribution":"Independently assess the full original outcome. Inputs:\n- the original source and the oracle rubric\n- the exact corrected CLI (fe8f4080…)\n- the four written assets\n- the current admitted C2 re-measurement\n\nCover:\n- written content and how it corresponds to the source and to predecessor assets\n- verifier adequacy\n- how the execution plan corresponds to the fixed commands\n- the consequential revision: the baseline failure (7d8d…) stays historical evidence about the earlier bytes and is causally linked through Construction (1f11…) to the corrected subject\n\nPreserve any unmet or indeterminate criteria.","reason":"Parent completion needs an independent semantic assessment by a distinct actor, over exact current evidence, for every obligation. Completed children, file presen